GPIO_TC_013	GPIO Group Interrupt Enable Register (gp0_intr1_intr_en1) Verification	Verify the group interrupt enable register at offset 0x84. Each bit enables/disables the interrupt for the corresponding GPIO pin in interrupt group 1.	test_gpio_level_sel_intr_en	program.c	GPIO	GPIO0	1	gp0_intr1_intr_en1	0x84	32	G8_intr_en to G39_intr_en	0-31	RW	0	hreset_n	System reset completed.	1. Read default value of gp0_intr1_intr_en1 (expect 0x00000000).
