GPIO_TC_014	GPIO Group Interrupt Masked Status Register (gp0_intr1_intr_sts1) Verification	Verify the group interrupt masked status register at offset 0x88. Each bit reflects the masked (enabled AND raw) interrupt status for the corresponding GPIO pin.	test_gpio_level_sel_intr_en	program.c	GPIO	GPIO0	1	gp0_intr1_intr_sts1	0x88	32	G8_intr_sts to G39_intr_sts	0-31	RO	0	hreset_n	System reset completed. Interrupts enabled via gp0_intr1_intr_en1.	1. Enable interrupt for GPIO pin i via gp0_intr1_intr_en1.
